### Commerce extensions, P13 (needs accessToken, storeId; productId from http/catalog.http)

@base = http://localhost:8080

### Discount code: 10 % off orders from 20.00, first 100 uses, once per customer
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "WELCOME10", "kind": "PERCENTAGE", "value": "10", "minimumSubtotal": "20.00", "usageLimit": 100, "oncePerCustomer": true}

> {% client.global.set("discountId", response.body.id); %}

### Discounts with usage counts
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Disable a code
PATCH {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/discounts/{{discountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "DISABLED"}

### Shipping rate: up to 2 kg, everywhere, free from 50.00 (after discounts)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/shipping-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Standard", "maxWeightGrams": 2000, "price": "4.90", "freeOver": "50.00"}

### Shipping rate: EU express
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/shipping-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "EU Express", "countries": ["FR", "DE", "NL"], "price": "9.90"}

### Rates
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/shipping-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Product image, step 1: ask for an upload URL (declare the exact type and size of the file)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/images/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"contentType": "image/png", "sizeBytes": 2048, "alt": "Front view"}

> {% client.global.set("imageId", response.body.imageId); client.global.set("uploadUrl", response.body.upload.url); %}

### Step 2: PUT the file to storage, e.g.
###   curl -X PUT -H "Content-Type: image/png" --data-binary @front.png "<upload.url>"
### (the file must be exactly sizeBytes long and a real PNG)

### Step 3: complete (verifies the stored file)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/images/{{imageId}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Images with signed URLs (valid 1 h)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Remove an image (the file is deleted shortly after)
DELETE {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/images/{{imageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
